    "preamble": "Jagatpal Mahajan vs State Of Punjab And Another on 16 October, 2023 Author: Rajbir Sehrawat Bench: Rajbir Sehrawat Neutral Citation No:=2023:PHHC:134 2023:Phhc:134480 -1- Crm-M-48631-2023 In The High Court Of Punjab And Haryana At Chandigarh Crm-M-48631-2023 Date of decision: 16.10.2023 Jagatpal Mahajan ...Petitioner Versus State Of Punjab And Another ... Respondents Coram : Hon'Ble Mr. Justice Rajbir Sehrawat Present:- Mr. Dilpreet Singh Gandhi, Advocate, for the petitioner. **** Rajbir Sehrawat, J. (Oral) 1. The present petition has been filed by the petitioner under Section 482 Cr.P.C for quashing of order dated 19.08.2023 passed by the Chief Judicial Magistrate, Gurdaspur, whereby the petitioner was declared a proclaimed person in complaint bearing No.COMA-180-2018, under Sections 26/27 read with Section 59 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. 2. It is submitted by learned counsel for the petitioner that the respondent No.2 filed above-noted complaint against the petitioner wherein he had been summoned to face trial, vide order dated 03.06.2019.",
